  "text": "## FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS  \n**Q: Why is my interest rate lower than my friend's?**\nA: Your interest rate depends on your balance tier. If your balance is below £10,000, you earn Tier 1 rate (4.50%). Your friend earning 4.70% likely has £10,001+ in their account.  \n**Q: Will my rate ever go down?**\nA: Yes. If Bank of England cuts its base rate, your rate will decline (we maintain 2.5% margin over BoE).  \n**Q: Can I lock in today's rate?**\nA: SmartSaver is a variable rate product. Rates adjust monthly with market changes. If you want a fixed rate, consider a fixed-rate bond (future product).  \n**Q: When is interest paid?**\nA: Last business day of each month. Interest calculated daily and paid as lump sum each month.  \n---",
